{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-11_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-11",
  "title": "At Vendetta's Close",
  "storyCode": "10-12",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-11_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3cced26a5a689bc029ae76c7fa9e20ea5ca7e66daef927cfa86c8e557f01d13f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "It's so strange, Doctor. We definitely shook off the Sarkaz warriors from before..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But they're still coming without end.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "It's like they know our position.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Closure, are our communications being traced?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
          "text": "Not a chance, Amiya, I guarantee it! I set up triple-layer encryption on our transmitters! If they had the tech for that, then Theresis would've breached the landship a hundred times over by now!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "...Doctor, I believe Closure."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "They must be using some other method then."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Miss Amiya, we're a stone's throw from the rendezvous point!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "As long as we link up with Team 6, we can get in contact with the subterranean support unit. Once we're underground, the Sarkaz pursuing us will be out of luck."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "No, don't go that way."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Huh? Why... wait, what? Miss Siege, what are you doing here?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Weren't you under..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "Team 6 is..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Team 6 is what? Why do you look so... erk, Miss Indra, have you seen all that blood on your hands?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "Your soldiers, they... all gave their lives."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Th-That can't be right! Team 6 is still ahead of us, how could they have run into the Sarkaz?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "We don't have time to analyze how."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "Doctor, it wasn't the Sarkaz force pursuing us that killed Team 6's soldiers."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "You mean..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "The enemy they faced had terrifying Originium Arts... It was more of a massacre than a battle. Hardly any of them had even drawn their weapons."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "You sure it was Originium Arts?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "I don't believe that!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "I saw this red bug thing tear the soldiers' chests apart. Vina, you saw it too! That was a genuine monster!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "...So the perpetrator is no ordinary Sarkaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "We have to change course. Mr. Feist, are there any other routes we can take?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Feist",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Yes. But we don't have any support waiting on it. If we run into Sarkaz forces..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "We'll be in for another hard fight."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Find cover!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "Horn, what the hell is this?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "What did that Sarkaz throw at us, a bomb? None of us even saw it—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "...Originium Arts."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Eyes up!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "I... I just saw something red flash by in midair!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Retreat!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "It's like a thunderbolt or something! That's Originium Arts?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "These... abominable devils!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Still won't come out?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Your war, your battle, your fight, it can't be this game of runabout you're playing, can it White Wolf?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "Five aerial blood streaks at once?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "Horn, we have no chance of—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "No."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "No matter how strong the Arts... he's only one person."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "What did Victoria do in the past, to prevail over the Sarkaz again and again?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "You mean..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "How many bolts do we have left?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Cover me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Robben",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
          "text": "Yes, sir!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "A pitiful act of defiance—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Now... is our chance."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Counting on an Arts bombardment to make your escape?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I'll give you a rude awakening."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "—!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "What I said still stands. So long as my soldiers remain here, I will not flee."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Not bad after all, White Wolf. I see you have the bravado to reverse course and charge me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Such a shame then..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "––Rrgh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Whoever told you that a Sarkaz depends solely on Arts in a fight?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Even wielding no more than a sword—I can still defeat every last one of you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Beating me... may not be so difficult..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "But making me fall will... not be so easy."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "How very brave of you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "It's thanks to that valor of yours that I can end this battle that much quicker—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The instant he thrusts his sword out, the soldier before Manfred abruptly vanishes.\nShe seems to practically dissolve and melt through the wall behind her, leaving not even a ripple."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "These Arts are unfamiliar..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Vigilance!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "...A dagger from thin air?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "No, not from thin air..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "You react very fast."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I'm afraid I'd have one more hole in my chest otherwise."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Target found! Take aim!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "What the hell? They vanished again?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Th-They're too fast! I can't land a shot!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Shields up, up! Quick! Shit, are they able to blink?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Blink? No such Arts could be cast without leaving even a trace!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Or is this... a diversion?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Don't let them fool you! All men, cast precision aside! Attack at once!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "So long as the enemy is still in front of us, they have no escape!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Have we... hit them?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "General, there's no body."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "But the ground is shot to hell... Where can they still be hiding?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "General, behind you!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Show yourself, and your life is mine!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Really?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Manfred, you put it very well, but unfortunately... you were only half right."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Half?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Sarkaz do not depend solely on Arts to fight—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "—but in no world do Sarkaz wield swords alone."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Aarrghh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "The ground shouldn't be this soft—this place is going to swallow us! I-I'm losing my grip on my blade!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "General, you're sinking too?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "...Nobody move, and nobody panic."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "The dagger is his staff. These are Arts, and nothing more than Arts."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "You're very calm-headed. Good... you've saved your men's lives."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "However..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Rgh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "The ground's... nearing my stomach..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "My sword..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "With your swordsmanship, blocking my attacks would be a simple task."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "But the more you struggle, the quicker the ground swallows you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Is this how you want to go... this self-destruction?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Urgh... *cough* *cough*..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "General—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "No one come near!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Or, you could cease all movements, same as your men."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "You want me to wait as you run my heart through?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "It'd be tough, killing you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "*cough* *cough*... *pant*..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I see now. You're not actually here to take my life."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I never imagined that outside of Ascalon, Rhodes Island would have yet another apex Sarkaz assassin."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "I'm no assassin."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Unless it's called for, I have zero desire to harm any Sarkaz at all."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "But here you are, abetting our enemies!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Are these Victorians... your enemies?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "What I see is a group of bruised, weary warriors, on the soil of their own home, struggling painfully just to live."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "You and Theresis, on the other hand, are turning the Sarkaz into the enemy of all."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I had entertained having a talk with your people, if I had the chance."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "It's a sorry thing, that we should first meet on the battlefield—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "—Rhodes Island Elite Operator."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "He's gone again? Ngh—the ground's back to normal!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "A hair's breadth."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I was on the cusp of capturing him. His Arts are all too exceptional... He can induce hallucinations without influencing our nervous systems."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "There are marks of energy transformation on the ground. Could it be...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "General, they're all gone! Those Victoria soldiers, I mean—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Keh... He would visit me and stall for time, just to extricate those half-dead soldiers one by one?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Are... Are we pursuing them, then?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "Do you think we can?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "I may have called it a hair's breadth, but against a Caster of that level, a hair's breadth is tantamount to guaranteed failure."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "Dammit! We were set to clean out all the rebel forces by today! Now a mercenary's gone traitor AND some mystery Caster's held us back!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "It's Rhodes Island... This is all because of Rhodes Island."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "We missed our chance to round them up in their entirety, but their losses can't be light, can they?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "They had their chance to hide in the dark, but now they've been driven front and center. For them, revealing their forces is already a colossal tactical defeat."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "An assassin, an expert spacial illusionist Caster, and the as-yet unseen Banshee... How many cards does Rhodes Island still have up their sleeve?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
          "text": "General, what are your plans?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "...Let us go. Before we deal with Rhodes Island, we first need to put the discontented clown in its place."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "This should be far enough for now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "...Is this outside of the factory district?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "You... cut open space with your dagger?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Don't always trust your senses. Tricking your eyes is much easier than influencing space."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "You've..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "You've rescued me, and not just once. My eyes might not show me the truest answers, but my senses never lie."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Just who are you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Misery. I'm Misery of Rhodes Island."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Rhodes Island?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "I'm sorry..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "You'll get a chance to hear a full explanation from Bagpipe in due time."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Bagpipe?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "She's a coworker at this point."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Not to mention... the last friend my best friend ever made."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Sounds like I've been quite a bit out of the loop."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "But before I lose myself to the joy that Bagpipe made it out, allow me to once again thank you and Rhodes Island."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Let's get out of here first. Chances are we'll be meeting again soon enough."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Manfred's almost worked out the truth of my Originium Arts. He could be coming after us any moment now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "...No. I imagine he'll be busy with something else right now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "You mean Dublinn."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "County Hillock's Mandragora... There's no way she's leaving this factory now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
          "text": "Are you giving yourself grief for not being able to personally avenge your comrades?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "I... I'm just lamenting."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Myself for standing here, regretting that I missed the opportunity to kill her..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Horn",
          "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
          "text": "Or her, for being long since beyond saving."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "That's odd. This is what you agreed with them, right? Why aren't they here to back us up?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
          "text": "I—argh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "What the hell is it—?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
          "text": "Sarkaz! It's Sarkaz! We have to run—"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "...Were we spotted?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "No. Not like this. 'Spy', we have to go—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Only ten meters to that sliding door there, right? Just ten meters, and we're right out, and..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "A... Alright, let's run..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Just like we used to, you pulling me. We only had to run fast enough that those noble kids couldn't catch us..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Grotesques! Get down, block them!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Bastards! Can't even rely on you in a time like this?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "Mandragora..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "What? Didn't I tell you to stay quiet for now?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "I can't keep walking. You go."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "What...? Can't you see? I've been doing all this just to..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "To save me? Or to gain favor with the Leader?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Is there a difference? What are you talking about? We're just five meters away, our people are right outside!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "They're gone."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "What?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "Mandragora... The Leader... she's long since abandoned us..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "'Spy'!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Bastard, bastard—stones, go! Skewer them, impale every one of those Sarkaz!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "You'll be alright, 'Spy', it's just an arrow, we're three meters away, even if I have to carry you—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "...Just go."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "If you can make it out..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Taran Secret Agent",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_421_1",
          "text": "Don't... Don't head for the Leader."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "...Did you just die?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Who said you could die so easily...? I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Cillian, Cillian... you bloody disgrace! I'm not letting you die here, you stand up for me, stand up!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "No need to work yourself up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "You won't live much longer either, Mandragora. You and your old Taran friend will meet again before you know it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Ha... hahahaha!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Manfred, you cost me another eleven lives."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "You don't know the half... you don't know anything of what it took to kill that many Sarkaz."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Manfred",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
          "text": "...This is exactly why you must die here."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "Perfect... drop yourselves right in my lap."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mandragora",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
          "text": "I'll crush every one of you into paste, no prisoners."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
